587
00:32:41,000 --> 00:32:42,730
and set up

588
00:32:42,750 --> 00:32:43,660
this power-draining formation?

589
00:32:43,790 --> 00:32:45,250
Not only that.

590
00:32:47,350 --> 00:32:49,010
I also ruined Qi Yuan's foundation,

591
00:32:49,440 --> 00:32:51,570
used Gnatsting Needle

592
00:32:51,590 --> 00:32:54,250
on our fellows,

593
00:32:54,270 --> 00:32:54,980
used Westdawn Sect

594
00:32:55,000 --> 00:32:57,530
for my Aureate Immortal Tribulation,

595
00:32:57,750 --> 00:32:58,570
and expelled all elders

596
00:32:59,720 --> 00:33:02,050
who opposed me.

597
00:33:03,160 --> 00:33:04,250
Elder Kuai.

598
00:33:06,480 --> 00:33:07,250
It was you?

599
