Why isn't it Jiu Jiu?

600
00:33:15,030 --> 00:33:15,730
Junior.

601
00:33:16,270 --> 00:33:16,980
Junior.

602
00:33:19,000 --> 00:33:20,010
If it were Jiu Jiu,

603
00:33:20,030 --> 00:33:22,050
her sword could've held
an incense stick's time.

604
00:33:22,480 --> 00:33:23,660
But Uncle Jiu Wu...

605
00:33:25,310 --> 00:33:27,530
You're buying time.

606
00:33:28,110 --> 00:33:28,810
Elder Kuai,

607
00:33:30,200 --> 00:33:31,050
I never expected

608
00:33:31,720 --> 00:33:33,730
