a real talent.

620
00:34:07,350 --> 00:34:09,090
If you'd follow me,

621
00:34:09,710 --> 00:34:10,820
from now on,

622
00:34:11,630 --> 00:34:13,170
my trust in you

623
00:34:15,760 --> 00:34:19,380
will far surpass that
of Detached Master.

624
00:34:23,110 --> 00:34:24,490
Are you willing?

625
00:34:34,030 --> 00:34:35,010
It's too late.

626
00:34:37,190 --> 00:34:38,740
Why do they keep multiplying?

627
00:34:47,960 --> 00:34:48,740
Our sect

628
00:34:49,280 --> 00:34:50,650
