684
00:37:11,460 --> 00:37:15,160
♪From primal chaos♪

685
00:37:15,160 --> 00:37:19,520
♪To the starry sky♪

686
00:37:19,520 --> 00:37:23,100
♪In the whole world♪

687
00:37:23,100 --> 00:37:24,190
♪We shall hold the balance♪

688
00:37:24,190 --> 00:37:25,610
Junior Qi Yuan,

689
00:37:26,030 --> 00:37:27,130
this time,

690
00:37:27,590 --> 00:37:29,690
