691
00:37:32,800 --> 00:37:34,780
Traitor, face death!

692
00:37:43,840 --> 00:37:45,940
♪The cauldron tempers divine blades♪

693
00:37:45,940 --> 00:37:49,900
♪The furnace refines the empty void♪

694
00:37:51,720 --> 00:37:53,870
♪The Way is in mystic fate♪

695
00:37:56,320 --> 00:37:57,090
Get away.

696
00:37:57,110 --> 00:37:57,860
Get away.

697
00:38:13,190 --> 00:38:14,650
Thank you for your help.

698
00:38:15,110 --> 00:38:17,260
May I ask your name?

699
00:38:17,510 --> 00:38:19,210
I'm a nameless disciple
from Ascendance Sect.

700
00:38:21,480 --> 00:38:22,650
