Changgeng has a plan to win.

706
00:38:35,320 --> 00:38:36,170
Please come with me.

707
00:38:36,190 --> 00:38:36,820
I am not going.

708
00:38:37,320 --> 00:38:38,490
I have not said where yet.

709
00:38:38,510 --> 00:38:39,420
I am not going anywhere.

710
00:38:39,440 --> 00:38:41,420
It's Seizing vs Human. What's it to me?

711
00:38:41,440 --> 00:38:42,260
You're truly not going?

712
00:38:42,280 --> 00:38:43,260
Absolutely not.

713
00:38:43,920 --> 00:38:44,460
Will you go or not?

714
00:38:44,480 --> 00:38:45,170
What are you doing?

715
00:38:45,480 --> 00:38:47,610
Quick! Pull me up!

716
00:38:47,630 --> 00:38:48,820
Pull me up!

717
00:38:49,280 --> 00:38:50,130
