718
00:38:50,150 --> 00:38:51,260
Will you go or not?

719
00:38:51,440 --> 00:38:52,980
How dare you threaten me?

720
00:38:53,320 --> 00:38:54,170
Will you go or not?

721
00:38:54,760 --> 00:38:55,530
How dare you threaten me?

722
00:38:55,550 --> 00:38:56,570
This is no threat.

723
00:38:56,920 --> 00:38:58,980
It's a request to forces
against this crisis.

724
00:38:59,280 --> 00:39:00,260
Joining forces?

725
